<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>OpenHome Market | Sell Your Home Your Way</title>

  <style>
    :root {
      --navy: #12304a;
      --blue: #2878a8;
      --gold: #d9a441;
      --light: #f5f8fa;
      --text: #17212b;
      --muted: #667481;
      --white: #ffffff;
      --border: #dfe7ec;
      --success: #2c8b63;
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    body {
      font-family: Inter, Arial, sans-serif;
      color: var(--text);
      background: var(--white);
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    a {
      color: inherit;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    button,
    input,
    select {
      font: inherit;
    }

    .container {
      width: min(1160px, 92%);
      margin: auto;
    }

    .topbar {
      background: var(--navy);
      color: white;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      padding: 8px 0;
    }

    .topbar-content {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 20px;
    }

    header {
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      background: white;
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 20;
    }

    .nav {
      height: 76px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 30px;
    }

    .logo {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      font-size: 1.35rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: var(--navy);
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .logo-mark {
      width: 38px;
      height: 38px;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      border-radius: 10px;
      background: var(--blue);
      color: white;
      font-weight: 900;
      font-size: 1.3rem;
    }

    .nav-links {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 25px;
      color: #43515d;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
    }

    .nav-links a:hover {
      color: var(--blue);
    }

    .nav-actions {
      display: flex;
      gap: 10px;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .btn {
      border: none;
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 12px 19px;
      font-weight: 700;
      cursor: pointer;
      display: inline-block;
      transition: 0.2s ease;
    }

    .btn:hover {
      transform: translateY(-1px);
      opacity: 0.92;
    }

    .btn-primary {
      background: var(--blue);
      color: white;
    }

    .btn-secondary {
      background: white;
      color: var(--navy);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .btn-gold {
      background: var(--gold);
      color: var(--navy);
    }

    .hero {
      background:
        linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(18, 48, 74, 0.95), rgba(18, 48, 74, 0.78)),
        url("https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1564013799919-ab600027ffc6?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1800&q=85")
        center/cover;
      color: white;
      padding: 95px 0 105px;
    }

    .hero-content {
      max-width: 720px;
    }

    .eyebrow {
      color: var(--gold);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 1.5px;
      font-weight: 800;
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 4.7rem);
      line-height: 1.06;
      margin-bottom: 22px;
      letter-spacing: -2px;
    }

    .hero p {
      font-size: 1.17rem;
      max-width: 610px;
      color: #e9f1f5;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
    }

    .hero-buttons {
      display: flex;
      gap: 12px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .search-box {
      background: white;
      padding: 18px;
      border-radius: 14px;
      box-shadow: 0 12px 35px rgba(0,0,0,0.14);
      margin-top: -38px;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 5;
    }

    .search-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr 1fr 1fr auto;
      gap: 10px;
    }

    input,
    select {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 13px 14px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 7px;
      color: var(--text);
      background: white;
    }

    section {
      padding: 80px 0;
    }

    .section-header {
      display: flex;
      align-items: end;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 25px;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
    }

    .section-header h2 {
      color: var(--navy);
      font-size: 2.1rem;
      line-height: 1.15;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .section-header p {
      color: var(--muted);
      max-width: 630px;
    }

    .property-grid,
    .provider-grid,
    .pricing-grid,
    .steps-grid {
      display: grid;
      gap: 22px;
    }

    .property-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    }

    .property-card {
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 13px;
      overflow: hidden;
      background: white;
      transition: 0.2s ease;
    }

    .property-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-4px);
      box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(18, 48, 74, 0.1);
    }

    .property-image {
      height: 210px;
      background-size: cover;
      background-position: center;
      position: relative;
    }

    .badge {
      position: absolute;
      top: 13px;
      left: 13px;
      background: white;
      color: var(--navy);
      padding: 5px 9px;
      border-radius: 5px;
      font-weight: 800;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
    }

    .property-details {
      padding: 18px;
    }

    .price {
      color: var(--navy);
      font-size: 1.35rem;
      font-weight: 800;
    }

    .property-details h3 {
      font-size: 1rem;
      margin: 5px 0;
    }

    .property-details p {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }

    .property-meta {
      display: flex;
      gap: 14px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      margin: 14px 0;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      padding-top: 12px;
    }

    .steps-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    }

    .step {
      background: var(--light);
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 25px;
    }

    .step-number {
      width: 38px;
      height: 38px;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      border-radius: 50%;
      color: white;
      background: var(--blue);
      font-weight: 800;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    .step h3 {
      color: var(--navy);
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .step p {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.92rem;
    }

    .choice-section {
      background: var(--navy);
      color: white;
    }

    .choice-content {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 55px;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .choice-content h2 {
      font-size: 2.5rem;
      line-height: 1.15;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    .choice-content p {
      color: #dce8ef;
      margin-bottom: 22px;
    }

    .choice-list {
      display: grid;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .choice-list div {
      display: flex;
      gap: 10px;
      align-items: start;
      color: #eff6f9;
    }

    .choice-list span {
      color: var(--gold);
      font-weight: 900;
    }

    .calculator {
      background: white;
      color: var(--text);
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 26px;
    }

    .calculator h3 {
      color: var(--navy);
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    .calc-row {
      display: grid;
      gap: 7px;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }

    .savings-result {
      margin-top: 18px;
      padding: 16px;
      background: #edf8f2;
      color: var(--success);
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-weight: 800;
    }

    .provider-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    }

    .provider-card {
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 22px;
      background: white;
    }

    .provider-icon {
      width: 45px;
      height: 45px;
      border-radius: 9px;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      background: #eaf4f8;
      color: var(--blue);
      font-weight: 900;
      font-size: 1.3rem;
      margin-bottom: 17px;
    }

    .provider-card h3 {
      color: var(--navy);
      margin-bottom: 7px;
    }

    .provider-card p {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    .provider-link {
      color: var(--blue);
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      font-weight: 800;
    }

    .pricing-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    }

    .pricing-card {
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 13px;
      padding: 28px;
    }

    .pricing-card.featured {
      border: 2px solid var(--blue);
      position: relative;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(40,120,168,0.13);
    }

    .popular {
      position: absolute;
      top: -13px;
      right: 20px;
      background: var(--gold);
      color: var(--navy);
      padding: 4px 10px;
      border-radius: 4px;
      font-size: 0.73rem;
      font-weight: 800;
    }

    .pricing-card h3 {
      color: var(--navy);
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .amount {
      font-size: 2.2rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: var(--navy);
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }

    .pricing-card p {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      min-height: 48px;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    .pricing-card ul {
      list-style: none;
      display: grid;
      gap: 10px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      margin-bottom: 22px;
    }

    .pricing-card li::before {
      content: "✓";
      color: var(--success);
      font-weight: 800;
      margin-right: 8px;
    }

    .cta {
      background: #eaf4f8;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .cta h2 {
      color: var(--navy);
      font-size: 2.4rem;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .cta p {
  max-width: 620px;
  margin: 0 auto 25px;
  color: var(--muted);
}

.listing-section {
  background: #eaf4f8;
  text-align: center;
}

.listing-form {
  max-width: 700px;
  margin: 25px auto 0;
  display: grid;
  gap: 12px;
  text-align: left;
}

.listing-form textarea {
  width: 100%;
  padding: 13px 14px;
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: 7px;
  color: var(--text);
  resize: vertical;
}

.form-two-column {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 12px;
}

.form-message {
  display: none;
  color: var(--success);
  font-weight: 700;
  text-align: center;
  padding: 10px;
  background: #edf8f2;
  border-radius: 7px;
}

.form-message.show {
  display: block;
}

    
  <div class="container">
    <h2>List Your Home</h2>

    <p>
      Start your San Antonio property listing. Your information will be
      reviewed before appearing on OpenHome Market.
    </p>

    <form id="propertyForm" style="max-width:700px;margin:25px auto 0;text-align:left;">
      <div style="display:grid;gap:12px;">

        <input
          type="text"
          id="sellerName"
          placeholder="Your full name"
          required
        />

        <input
          type="email"
          id="sellerEmail"
          placeholder="Your email address"
          required
        />

        <input
          type="tel"
          id="sellerPhone"
          placeholder="Your phone number"
          required
        />

        <input
          type="text"
          id="propertyAddress"
          placeholder="Property address"
          required
        />

        <input
          type="number"
          id="askingPrice"
          placeholder="Asking price"
          min="0"
          required
        />

        <select id="listingType" required>
          <option value="">Select property type</option>
          <option value="House">House</option>
          <option value="Townhome">Townhome</option>
          <option value="Condo">Condo</option>
          <option value="Land">Land</option>
        </select>

        <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px;">
          <input
            type="number"
            id="bedroomCount"
            placeholder="Bedrooms"
            min="0"
            required
          />

          <input
            type="number"
            id="bathroomCount"
            placeholder="Bathrooms"
            min="0"
            step="0.5"
            required
          />
        </div>

        <input
          type="number"
          id="squareFeet"
          placeholder="Square feet"
          min="0"
        />

        <textarea
          id="propertyDescription"
          placeholder="Describe your property"
          rows="5"
          style="width:100%;padding:13px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:7px;font:inherit;"
          required
        ></textarea>

        <button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit">
          Submit Property for Review
        </button>

        <p
          id="propertyMessage"
          style="display:none;color:var(--success);font-weight:700;"
        >
          Thank you. Your property has been submitted for review.
        </p>

      </div>
    </form>
  </div>
</section>

    footer {
      background: #0c2235;
      color: white;
      padding: 45px 0 25px;
    }

    .footer-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 35px;
      margin-bottom: 35px;
    }

    footer h3 {
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    footer p,
    footer a {
      color: #b9cbd5;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }

    footer a {
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .footer-bottom {
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
      padding-top: 18px;
      color: #9fb4c0;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
    }

    .mobile-menu {
      display: none;
      border: none;
      background: transparent;
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      color: var(--navy);
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      .nav-links {
        display: none;
      }

      .mobile-menu {
        display: block;
      }

      .search-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      }

      .property-grid,
      .pricing-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      }

      .provider-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      }

      .steps-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      }

      .choice-content {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .footer-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 600px) 
    .form-two-column {
  grid-template-columns: 1fr;


      .topbar-content {
        display: block;
        text-align: center;
      }

      .nav {
        height: 66px;
      }

      .nav-actions .btn-secondary {
        display: none;
      }

      .hero {
        padding: 70px 0 90px;
      }

      h1 {
        font-size: 2.8rem;
      }

      .search-grid,
      .property-grid,
      .provider-grid,
      .pricing-grid,
      .steps-grid,
      .footer-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .section-header {
        display: block;
      }

      .section-header .btn {
        margin-top: 15px;
      }

      .choice-content h2,
      .cta h2 {
        font-size: 2rem;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <div class="topbar">
    <div class="container topbar-content">
      <span>Launching in San Antonio, Texas</span>
      <span>Transparent tools. Flexible professional help.</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <header>
    <div class="container nav">
      <a class="logo" href="#">
        <span class="logo-mark">O</span>
        OpenHome Market
      </a>

      <nav class="nav-links">
        <a href="#buy">Buy</a>
        <a href="#sell">Sell</a>
        <a href="#how-it-works">How It Works</a>
        <a href="#services">Services</a>
        <a href="#pricing">Pricing</a>
      </nav>

      <div class="nav-actions">
        <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="#">Sign In</a>
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="#sell">List Your Home</a>
        <button class="mobile-menu">☰</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="container hero-content">
        <div class="eyebrow">San Antonio real estate, made more open</div>
        <h1>Sell your home your way.</h1>
        <p>
          List directly, connect with buyers, and choose the professional
          services you need—with transparent pricing and no unnecessary steps.
        </p>

        <div class="hero-buttons">
  <a class="btn btn-gold" href="#list-your-home">
    List Your San Antonio Home
  </a>

  <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="#buy">
    Find a Home
  </a>
</div>

      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="container search-box" id="buy">
      <div class="search-grid">
        <input id="locationSearch" type="text" placeholder="Search San Antonio, ZIP code, or neighborhood" />
        <select id="propertyType">
          <option value="">Property type</option>
          <option value="House">House</option>
          <option value="Townhome">Townhome</option>
          <option value="Condo">Condo</option>
        </select>
        <select id="bedrooms">
          <option value="">Bedrooms</option>
          <option value="2">2+ beds</option>
          <option value="3">3+ beds</option>
          <option value="4">4+ beds</option>
        </select>
        <select id="priceRange">
          <option value="">Price range</option>
          <option value="300000">Under $300,000</option>
          <option value="450000">Under $450,000</option>
          <option value="600000">Under $600,000</option>
        </select>
        <button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="filterHomes()">Search</button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <section>
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-header">
          <div>
            <h2>Featured San Antonio homes</h2>
            <p>Explore sample listings from homeowners using the OpenHome Market approach.</p>
          </div>
          <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="#buy">View All Homes</a>
        </div>

        <div class="property-grid" id="propertyGrid">
          <article class="property-card" data-location="stone oak san antonio 78258" data-type="House" data-bedrooms="4" data-price="479000">
            <div class="property-image" style="background-image:url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600585154340-be6161a56a0c?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=80')">
              <span class="badge">For Sale</span>
            </div>
            <div class="property-details">
              <div class="price">$479,000</div>
              <h3>Modern Family Home</h3>
              <p>Stone Oak, San Antonio, TX 78258</p>
              <div class="property-meta">
                <span>4 beds</span>
                <span>3 baths</span>
                <span>2,460 sq ft</span>
              </div>
              <button class="btn btn-primary" style="width:100%" onclick="showMessage('Property details are available in the full application.')">
                View Property
              </button>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="property-card" data-location="alamo heights san antonio 78209" data-type="House" data-bedrooms="3" data-price="389000">
            <div class="property-image" style="background-image:url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600607687920-4e2a09cf159d?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=80')">
              <span class="badge">Owner Listed</span>
            </div>
            <div class="property-details">
              <div class="price">$389,000</div>
              <h3>Charming Alamo Heights Home</h3>
              <p>Alamo Heights, San Antonio, TX 78209</p>
              <div class="property-meta">
                <span>3 beds</span>
                <span>2 baths</span>
                <span>1,820 sq ft</span>
              </div>
              <button class="btn btn-primary" style="width:100%" onclick="showMessage('Property details are available in the full application.')">
                View Property
              </button>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="property-card" data-location="helotes san antonio 78023" data-type="Townhome" data-bedrooms="3" data-price="319000">
            <div class="property-image" style="background-image:url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600566753190-17f0baa2a6c3?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=80')">
              <span class="badge">New Listing</span>
            </div>
            <div class="property-details">
              <div class="price">$319,000</div>
              <h3>Bright Hill Country Townhome</h3>
              <p>Helotes, TX 78023</p>
              <div class="property-meta">
                <span>3 beds</span>
                <span>2.5 baths</span>
                <span>1,650 sq ft</span>
              </div>
              <button class="btn btn-primary" style="width:100%" onclick="showMessage('Property details are available in the full application.')">
                View Property
              </button>
            </div>
          </article>
        </div>

        <p id="noResults" style="display:none; color:var(--muted); margin-top:25px;">
          No sample homes matched your search.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="choice-section" id="sell">
      <div class="container choice-content">
        <div>
          <div class="eyebrow">More choice. More transparency.</div>
          <h2>You decide how much help you need.</h2>
          <p>
            OpenHome Market gives homeowners the tools to manage the process
            directly while making licensed professionals available when needed.
          </p>

          <div class="choice-list">
            <div><span>✓</span> Create and manage your own property listing</div>
            <div><span>✓</span> Communicate with interested buyers</div>
            <div><span>✓</span> Schedule showings online</div>
            <div><span>✓</span> Compare professional services and costs</div>
            <div><span>✓</span> Add broker, attorney, inspection, title, or lending support</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="calculator">
          <h3>Illustrative cost calculator</h3>

          <div class="calc-row">
            <label for="homePrice">Estimated home price</label>
            <input id="homePrice" type="number" value="400000" oninput="calculateSavings()" />
          </div>

          <div class="calc-row">
            <label for="platformCost">Estimated platform and selected-service cost</label>
            <input id="platformCost" type="number" value="6750" oninput="calculateSavings()" />
          </div>

          <div class="savings-result" id="savingsResult">
